    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期是反向访谈，感谢不打瞌睡的研讨会的采访，聊一下我最新鲜的生命观和对生命的见解。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期金句的节选，感谢播客的创作者Abby 和米哈，可以提前剧透一下聊了啥：</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>人可以如此的不同却又如此的相似</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>所有的阻碍都是自己认知心智上的阻碍</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>跳出舒适圈不是推翻之前的圈，而是在自己的能力范围内尝试新事物</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>女性成长这个词已经out，更多的是需要男性成长</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>内在的自由与宁静才是最大的成功</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>🚪【传送门】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">3:00</a> 内森的多重斜杠身份</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">5:00</a> 做影响者的生命教练</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">9:00</a> 跳出舒适圈的新解释</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 聊聊腾讯裸辞的经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 不上班只做全职主夫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1849">30:49</a> 如何有一段好的亲密关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> 如何从人生谷底爬出来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3100">51:40</a> 如何建立内在自信</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3765">01:02:45</a> 如何定义成功和财富</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4140">01:09:00</a> 如何找到自己的使命&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎤【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>内森 Nathan</span></p><span></span><p><span>做影响者的生命教练</span></p><span></span><p><span>前腾讯产品运营</span></p><span></span><p><span>B站知名Up主</span></p><span></span><p><span>ICF国际认证教练</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔍【发现】</span></p><span></span><p><span>-B站：内森の日常</span></p><span></span><p><span>-小红书：小猴子日常</span></p><span></span><p><span>-公众号：内森的日常</span></p><span></span><p><span>🤝【精神股东】</span></p><span></span><p><span>每位听友都是我的精神股东，欢迎加入内森的