  <item>
    <title>E40.串台铁林想聊：做视频Vlog创作者都有什么样的心流体验</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66261e2dc3e09d8f37aa51d2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66261e2dc3e09d8f37aa51d2</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 22 Apr 2024 08:22:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是一期播客串台，有幸被铁林教练邀请，上了他的播客，一起聊聊我做了10多年的Vlog和视频创作的思考。</span></p><span></span><p><span>以下是一些经典节选，也有另外一位嘉宾一起碰撞，听听我们三个人都有什么不同角度的思考。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🚪【传送门】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">02:03</a> 一个博主在中国和新加坡的剪片经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="311">05:11</a>旅程中的创作奇迹：剪辑艺术与个人成长的探索</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="629">10:29</a>重新捡回爱好的动力：从母婴产品介绍到内容创作的转变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="944">15:44</a>创意视频制作：从IDEA到最终作品的成就感与挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1259">20:59</a>土豆网的口号：人人可以做自己生活的导演</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1574">26:14</a>建立你的剪辑小闭环：学习剪辑的正确态度和步骤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1889">31:29</a>短视频创作秘籍：剪映里的特效音效音乐，打造完美视频！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2204">36:44</a>重新定位的挑战：如何在变化的时代中找到自己的声音？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2521">42:01</a>人人都能成为自己的大师：寻找专业领域的独特之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2835">47:15</a>剪辑艺术中的同频效应：为何旁边的人能感受到你的创作之美？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3150">52:30</a>如何通过剪辑和DJ技艺来打造感染人心弦的表演艺术？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3465">57:45</a>心流的创作：剪辑中的体现与影响力</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎤【主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>薛铁鏻</span></p><span></span><p><span>教练吧创始人</span></p><span></span><p><span>ICF（国际教练联盟）MCC级别的教练</span></p><span></span><p><span>曾在两家上市公司任副总裁</span></p><span></span><p><span>金牛和瑞投资集团合伙人</span></p><span></span><p><span>中国传媒大学特聘客座讲师</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎤【同场嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Orange</span></p><span></span><p><span>上海人在泰国自主创业</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎤【嘉宾】</span></p><span></span><p><span>内森 Nathan</span></p><span></span><p><span>做影响者的生命教练</span></p><span></span><p><span>前腾讯产品运营</span></p><span></span><p><span>B站知名Up主</span></p><span></span><p><span>ICF国际认证教练</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔍【发现】</span></p><span></span><p><span>-B站：内森の日常</span></p><span></span><p><span>-小红书：小猴子日常</span></p><span></span><p><span>-公众号：内森的日常</span></p><span></span><p><span>🤝【精神股东】</span></p><span></span><p><span>每位听友都是我的精神股东，欢迎加入内森的股东群</span></p><span></span><p><span>围观内森的成长分享</span></p><span></span><p><span>扫码添加内森：nathanli0502</span></p><span></span><p><span>备注：股东</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmIC-RsKLmiWFs1XkRgtkxia7nsC.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
